  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v3.67.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.66.0:\n\n- [minor] Deliver files dropped onto the window to OnFilesDropped (#614) ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- Stop a divider handle taking clicks meant for a popup over it (#613) ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- Guard the skew divisions by magnitude rather than float equality ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- [minor] Skew the transform box by Ctrl-dragging an edge ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Leave the Silk.NET file-drop wiring out of the iOS head ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Deliver files dropped onto the window to OnFilesDropped [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
